{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/issues/2307","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/issues/2307/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/issues/2307/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/issues/2307/events","html_url":"https://github.com/emilk/egui/issues/2307","id":1448572259,"node_id":"I_kwDOCd2s285WV3Vj","number":2307,"title":"Plot bounds broken when all y values are the same","user":{"login":"nknotts","id":5288782,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODg3ODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5288782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nknotts","html_url":"https://github.com/nknotts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nknotts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nknotts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nknotts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nknotts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nknotts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nknotts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nknotts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nknotts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nknotts/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1191600517,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTkxNjAwNTE3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"FBCA04","default":true,"description":"Something is broken"},{"id":1191600520,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTkxNjAwNTIw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed"},{"id":1191600521,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTkxNjAwNTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":3411878425,"node_id":"LA_kwDOCd2s287LXSIZ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/labels/egui_plot","name":"egui_plot","color":"bfdadc","default":false,"description":"Related to egui_plot"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2022-11-14T18:54:07Z","updated_at":"2024-06-07T09:13:19Z","closed_at":"2024-06-07T09:13:19Z","author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nWhen all y values are identically the same, the calculated y bounds will be considered invalid and the default y-range of [0, 1] will be used instead. The same bug applies to x as well.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nI've created an example application here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/nknotts/egui/blob/added-plot-bounds-example/examples/plot_bounds/src/main.rs\r\n\r\nThe gist is\r\n\r\n```\r\n            let x_range = 0..1000;\r\n            let single2: PlotPoints = x_range\r\n                .clone()\r\n                .map(|i| {\r\n                    let x = i as f64 * 0.01;\r\n                    [x, 2.0]\r\n                })\r\n                .collect();\r\n\r\n            ui.label(\"All values == 2, completely missing\");\r\n            Plot::new(\"plot3\")\r\n                .allow_drag(false)\r\n                .allow_zoom(false)\r\n                .allow_scroll(false)\r\n                .height(row_height)\r\n                .show(ui, |plot_ui| plot_ui.line(Line::new(single2)));\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhere determining the bounds, there is\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/emilk/egui/blob/a1f6f6821366c95b36b43e83ba67bc7e8645e14a/crates/egui/src/widgets/plot/mod.rs#L831\r\n\r\n```\r\n        let auto_x = !bounds_modified.x && (!min_auto_bounds.is_valid_x() || auto_bounds.x);\r\n        let auto_y = !bounds_modified.y && (!min_auto_bounds.is_valid_y() || auto_bounds.y);\r\n```\r\n\r\nUltimately there is a call to\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/emilk/egui/blob/a1f6f6821366c95b36b43e83ba67bc7e8645e14a/crates/egui/src/widgets/plot/transform.rs#L52\r\n\r\n```\r\n    pub fn is_valid(&self) -> bool {\r\n        self.is_finite() && self.width() > 0.0 && self.height() > 0.0\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\nwhere, in this case, the height will be `== 0.0` since all values are the same. Since the y bounds are not valid, the default bounds of `[0, 1]` are used.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nAn appropriate bound to be calculated for this case.\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\n<img width=\"868\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2022-11-14 at 1 33 45 PM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5288782/201741817-8a7cb56f-a7b8-4785-ba07-80dbee7c7630.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\n**Desktop (please complete the following information):**\r\n - OS: macOS\r\n - Version 12.6\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n<!-- Add any other context about the problem here. -->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"abey79","id":49431240,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NDMxMjQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49431240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abey79","html_url":"https://github.com/abey79","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abey79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abey79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abey79/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abey79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abey79/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abey79/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abey79/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abey79/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abey79/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/issues/2307/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/emilk/egui/issues/2307/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}